---
import LiveBanner from "../components/LiveBanner.astro";
import PageFooter from "../components/PageFooter.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer" />
  <title>Accessibility Statement — countdowns.co</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Accessibility statement for countdowns.co — WCAG 2.1 AA conformance status, what has been tested, known limitations, and how to report an issue." />
  <style>.t-fr,.t-kr,.t-es{display:none}.lang-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}</style>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      background: #0f0f0f;
      color: #e0e0e0;
      font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; }
    a:hover { color: #4ade80; }

    .page { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 80px; }

    .header-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .site-title {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      color: #fff;
    }
    .site-title a { text-decoration: none; }

    .lang-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 4px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .lang-btn {
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid #555;
      border-radius: 3px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      color: #aaa;
      font-family: inherit;
      transition: all 0.15s;
    }
    .lang-btn:hover { border-color: #888; color: #eee; }
    .lang-btn.active { background: #1e3a5f; border-color: #2d6aa0; color: #7ec8e3; }

    .back-link { font-size: 12px; color: #999999; text-decoration: underline; }
    .back-link:hover { color: #4ade80; }

    .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #2e2e2e; margin: 28px 0; }

    h2 {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    p { color: #999999; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 13px; }

    li { color: #999999; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 6px; }

    .section { margin-bottom: 8px; }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .badge-info { background: #0a0f1a; color: #7ec8e3; border: 1px solid #1e3a5f; }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
<LiveBanner />
  <main class="page">

    <div class="header-row">
      <h1 class="site-title">
        <a href="/">Countdowns</a>
      </h1>
      <div class="lang-row">
        <a class="back-link" href="/">
          <span class="t-en">← Back</span>
          <span class="t-fr">← Retour</span>
          <span class="t-kr">← Retounen</span>
          <span class="t-es">← Volver</span>
        </a>
        <div class="lang-group">
          <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="en">EN</button>
          <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="fr">FR</button>
          <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="kr">KR</button>
          <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="es">ES</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <!-- FR -->
    <div class="t-fr">

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Déclaration d'accessibilité</h2>
        <p>countdowns.co s'engage à rendre son site accessible au plus grand nombre. Cette page décrit l'état actuel de conformité, ce qui a été testé, et comment signaler un problème.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Statut de conformité</h2>
        <span class="badge badge-info">Partiellement conforme — WCAG 2.1 niveau AA</span>
        <p>Ce statut signifie que certaines parties du contenu ne sont pas encore pleinement conformes, ou que la conformité n'a pas été vérifiée par une évaluation humaine complète (voir « Ce qui n'est pas encore fait » ci-dessous). Ce n'est pas une auto-certification définitive.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Ce qui a été fait</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Audit automatisé <strong>axe-core</strong> (règles WCAG 2.1 A/AA et 2.2) sur les 16 pages publiques du site — 0 violation détectée, y compris sur des règles hors du périmètre WCAG strict (landmarks, structure de titres).</li>
          <li>Structure sémantique : chaque page utilise des repères de navigation (<code>&lt;main&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;footer&gt;</code>, bannière <code>role="banner"</code>) et un titre <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code> unique.</li>
          <li>Contrastes de couleur vérifiés et corrigés (calcul du ratio de luminance réel, pas une estimation visuelle).</li>
          <li>Scan indépendant complémentaire via <a href="https://app.getwcag.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">getwcag.com</a>, outil tiers gratuit et consultable par n'importe qui.</li>
        </ul>
        <p><a href="https://app.getwcag.com/result/6lDNP7KCacj1DMJABFYM" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Voir un exemple de résultat de scan ↗</a> — capturé avant les correctifs de landmarks/titres ci-dessus (score 94/100, 2 problèmes signalés, tous deux corrigés depuis). Ce n'est pas un score en temps réel, mais ça donne une idée concrète de ce à quoi ressemble un scan, ses résultats, et les actions qu'il reste à faire.</p>
        <p>Preuves publiques : <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/pull/186" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PR #186</a>, <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/pull/187" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#187</a>, <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/pull/188" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#188</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Ce qui n'est pas encore fait</h2>
        <p>Aucune évaluation humaine complète n'a encore été réalisée : pas de test au clavier de bout en bout, pas de test avec un lecteur d'écran réel (VoiceOver, NVDA). Les outils automatisés ne détectent qu'un sous-ensemble des critères WCAG — l'ordre de lecture logique, la pertinence des textes alternatifs, ou l'expérience réelle avec une technologie d'assistance ne peuvent être vérifiés que manuellement. Cette évaluation manuelle est prévue à court terme (voir la <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/blob/main/ROADMAP.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">feuille de route</a> du projet).</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Méthode d'évaluation</h2>
        <p>Auto-évaluation par l'équipe du projet, à l'aide d'outils automatisés (axe-core, getwcag.com). Aucun audit externe rémunéré n'a été commandé.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Technologies utilisées</h2>
        <p>HTML, CSS, JavaScript. Site statique, sans framework JavaScript côté client lourd.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Signaler un problème</h2>
        <p>Si une partie du site ne vous est pas accessible, ouvrez une issue sur <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>. Décrivez la page concernée et le problème rencontré — nous répondons personnellement.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Date de publication</h2>
        <p>Cette déclaration a été publiée le 16 septembre 2026.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- EN -->
    <div class="t-en">

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Accessibility statement</h2>
        <p>countdowns.co is committed to making its site accessible to as many people as possible. This page describes the current conformance status, what has been tested, and how to report an issue.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Conformance status</h2>
        <span class="badge badge-info">Partially conformant — WCAG 2.1 level AA</span>
        <p>This status means some parts of the content are not yet fully conformant, or conformance has not been confirmed by a complete human evaluation (see "What hasn't been done" below). It is not a final self-certification.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>What has been done</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Automated <strong>axe-core</strong> audit (WCAG 2.1 A/AA and 2.2 rules) across all 16 public pages — 0 violations found, including rules outside the strict WCAG tag scope (landmarks, heading structure).</li>
          <li>Semantic structure: every page uses navigation landmarks (<code>&lt;main&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;footer&gt;</code>, a <code>role="banner"</code> announcement bar) and a single <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>.</li>
          <li>Color contrast checked and fixed (real luminance-ratio calculation, not a visual estimate).</li>
          <li>Complementary independent scan via <a href="https://app.getwcag.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">getwcag.com</a>, a free third-party tool anyone can run.</li>
        </ul>
        <p><a href="https://app.getwcag.com/result/6lDNP7KCacj1DMJABFYM" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">See an example scan result ↗</a> — captured before the landmark/heading fixes above (score 94/100, 2 issues flagged, both since resolved). It's not a live score, but it gives a concrete idea of what a scan looks like, what it finds, and what's left to fix.</p>
        <p>Public evidence: <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/pull/186" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PR #186</a>, <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/pull/187" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#187</a>, <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/pull/188" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#188</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>What hasn't been done yet</h2>
        <p>No complete human evaluation has been carried out yet: no end-to-end keyboard-only testing, no testing with a real screen reader (VoiceOver, NVDA). Automated tools only catch a subset of WCAG criteria — logical reading order, alt-text quality, or real assistive-technology experience can only be verified manually. This manual pass is planned in the near term (see the project's <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/blob/main/ROADMAP.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">roadmap</a>).</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Assessment approach</h2>
        <p>Self-evaluation by the project team, using automated tools (axe-core, getwcag.com). No paid external audit has been commissioned.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Technologies relied upon</h2>
        <p>HTML, CSS, JavaScript. Static site, no heavy client-side JavaScript framework.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Report an issue</h2>
        <p>If any part of the site isn't accessible to you, open an issue on <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>. Describe the page and the problem you encountered — we respond personally.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Publication date</h2>
        <p>This statement was published on September 16, 2026.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- KR -->
    <div class="t-kr">

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Deklarasyon aksesiblite</h2>
        <p>countdowns.co angaje pou fè sit li aksesib pou plis moun posib. Paj sa a dekri estati konfòmite aktyèl la, sa ki te teste, ak kijan pou siyale yon pwoblèm.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Estati konfòmite</h2>
        <span class="badge badge-info">Patyèlman konfòm — WCAG 2.1 nivo AA</span>
        <p>Estati sa a vle di kèk pati nan kontni an poko totalman konfòm, oswa konfòmite a poko konfime pa yon evalyasyon imen konplè (gade "Sa ki poko fèt" anba a). Se pa yon oto-sètifikasyon final.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Sa ki te fèt</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Odit otomatik <strong>axe-core</strong> (règ WCAG 2.1 A/AA ak 2.2) sou tout 16 paj piblik sit la — 0 vyolasyon jwenn, ki gen ladan règ ki depase seul WCAG strik la (landmark, estrikti tit).</li>
          <li>Estrikti semantik: chak paj itilize pwen referans navigasyon (<code>&lt;main&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;footer&gt;</code>, yon ba anonse <code>role="banner"</code>) ak yon sèl <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>.</li>
          <li>Kontras koulè verifye epi korije (kalkil vrè rapò limnyans, pa yon estimasyon vizyèl).</li>
          <li>Scan endepandan konplemantè atravè <a href="https://app.getwcag.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">getwcag.com</a>, yon zouti tyès gratis nenpòt moun ka fè kouri.</li>
        </ul>
        <p><a href="https://app.getwcag.com/result/6lDNP7KCacj1DMJABFYM" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Gade yon egzanp rezilta scan ↗</a> — kaptire anvan korije landmark/tit yo pi wo a (nòt 94/100, 2 pwoblèm siyale, tou de rezoud depi lè sa a). Se pa yon nòt an tan reyèl, men li bay yon lide konkrè sou sa yon scan sanble, sa li jwenn, ak sa ki rete pou korije.</p>
        <p>Prèv piblik: <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/pull/186" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PR #186</a>, <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/pull/187" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#187</a>, <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/pull/188" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#188</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Sa ki poko fèt</h2>
        <p>Poko gen okenn evalyasyon imen konplè: pa gen tès klavye total, pa gen tès ak yon vrè lekti ekran (VoiceOver, NVDA). Zouti otomatik yo sèlman detekte yon pati nan kritè WCAG yo — lòd lekti lojik, kalite tèks altènatif, oswa vrè eksperyans ak teknoloji asistans se sèlman verifyab manyèlman. Evalyasyon manyèl sa a planifye byento (gade <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/blob/main/ROADMAP.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">plan wout</a> pwojè a).</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Metòd evalyasyon</h2>
        <p>Oto-evalyasyon pa ekip pwojè a, ak zouti otomatik (axe-core, getwcag.com). Pa gen okenn odit ekstèn peye ki te kòmande.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Teknoloji itilize</h2>
        <p>HTML, CSS, JavaScript. Sit statik, san gwo framework JavaScript kote kliyan.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Siyale yon pwoblèm</h2>
        <p>Si yon pati nan sit la pa aksesib pou ou, ouvè yon issue sou <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>. Dekri paj la ak pwoblèm ou rankontre a — nou reponn pèsonèlman.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Dat piblikasyon</h2>
        <p>Deklarasyon sa a te pibliye 16 septanm 2026.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- ES -->
    <div class="t-es">

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Declaración de accesibilidad</h2>
        <p>countdowns.co se compromete a hacer su sitio accesible al mayor número de personas posible. Esta página describe el estado actual de conformidad, lo que se ha probado y cómo informar de un problema.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Estado de conformidad</h2>
        <span class="badge badge-info">Parcialmente conforme — WCAG 2.1 nivel AA</span>
        <p>Este estado significa que algunas partes del contenido aún no son totalmente conformes, o que la conformidad no ha sido confirmada mediante una evaluación humana completa (ver "Lo que aún no se ha hecho" más abajo). No es una autocertificación definitiva.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Lo que se ha hecho</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Auditoría automatizada <strong>axe-core</strong> (reglas WCAG 2.1 A/AA y 2.2) en las 16 páginas públicas del sitio — 0 violaciones detectadas, incluidas reglas fuera del alcance estricto de WCAG (landmarks, estructura de encabezados).</li>
          <li>Estructura semántica: cada página utiliza puntos de referencia de navegación (<code>&lt;main&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;footer&gt;</code>, una barra de aviso <code>role="banner"</code>) y un único <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>.</li>
          <li>Contraste de color verificado y corregido (cálculo real del ratio de luminancia, no una estimación visual).</li>
          <li>Escaneo independiente complementario mediante <a href="https://app.getwcag.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">getwcag.com</a>, una herramienta gratuita de terceros que cualquiera puede ejecutar.</li>
        </ul>
        <p><a href="https://app.getwcag.com/result/6lDNP7KCacj1DMJABFYM" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ver un ejemplo de resultado de escaneo ↗</a> — capturado antes de las correcciones de landmarks/encabezados anteriores (puntuación 94/100, 2 problemas señalados, ambos resueltos desde entonces). No es una puntuación en vivo, pero da una idea concreta de cómo se ve un escaneo, qué encuentra y qué queda por corregir.</p>
        <p>Evidencia pública: <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/pull/186" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PR #186</a>, <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/pull/187" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#187</a>, <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/pull/188" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#188</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Lo que aún no se ha hecho</h2>
        <p>Todavía no se ha realizado una evaluación humana completa: sin pruebas de teclado de extremo a extremo, sin pruebas con un lector de pantalla real (VoiceOver, NVDA). Las herramientas automatizadas solo detectan un subconjunto de los criterios WCAG — el orden de lectura lógico, la calidad del texto alternativo o la experiencia real con tecnología de asistencia solo pueden verificarse manualmente. Esta evaluación manual está prevista a corto plazo (ver la <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/blob/main/ROADMAP.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">hoja de ruta</a> del proyecto).</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Método de evaluación</h2>
        <p>Autoevaluación por el equipo del proyecto, usando herramientas automatizadas (axe-core, getwcag.com). No se ha encargado ninguna auditoría externa remunerada.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Tecnologías utilizadas</h2>
        <p>HTML, CSS, JavaScript. Sitio estático, sin un framework de JavaScript pesado del lado del cliente.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Informar de un problema</h2>
        <p>Si alguna parte del sitio no te resulta accesible, abre un issue en <a href="https://github.com/countdowns-co/caribbean-countdowns/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>. Describe la página y el problema encontrado — respondemos personalmente.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Fecha de publicación</h2>
        <p>Esta declaración se publicó el 16 de septiembre de 2026.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </main>

  <script is:inline src="/scripts/lang.js" defer></script>
<PageFooter />
</body>
</html>
